与柔和豆沙粉，整体明亮、干净、细腻、真实、抓眼，带高级美妆摄影、轻奢护肤广告和人像精修样片质感，85mm portrait look，浅景深，超高面部解析度", "一张高质量的超写实现代时尚人像摄影，画面呈现一位时尚的年轻亚洲女性，置身于极简主义的白色摄影棚中。她随意地坐在一块白色的几何方块上。她留着中长款的棕色波浪卷发，眼神自信而诱惑地直视镜头。她身穿白色紧身短款背心，搭配白色高腰短裤和一条细棕色皮带，腿上穿着性感的白色渔网袜。左手腕戴着配套的白色渔网短手套。她的造型由白色厚底高跟鞋完美收尾。背景左侧有透明玻璃几何方块或镜面立方体装置，反射着光线。灯光明亮、高调且柔和，营造出干净空灵的氛围。8k分辨率，电影级画质，脸部和腿部焦点锐利，强调时尚、自信和微妙的现代美学。", "一张电影级画质的特写人像摄影，画面聚焦于一位情绪饱满的年轻亚洲女性。她的黑色短发湿漉漉、凌乱地散落在脸颊和颈部。她身穿一件简约的黑色细吊带背心，露出精致的锁骨和深邃的胸部线条。脖子上佩戴着一条粗链条银色珍珠项链，为画面增添了一抹时尚感。她的皮肤呈现出微湿、光亮的质感，特别是在颈部和胸口处，水珠或汗珠清晰可见。光线处理上，采用了强烈而集中的侧面硬光，在湿润的头发、面部、颈部和胸部形成高光和清晰的阴影，制造出极具冲击力的明暗对比。她的眼神从凌乱的湿发中斜视向镜头，表情复杂而充满故事感，嘴唇微张，仿佛在无声地述说。背景是粗糙的灰色纹理墙壁，进一步增强了画面的颓废与艺术氛围。8k分辨率，超写实，电影感光影，湿发效果，情绪人像，高对比度，皮肤细节。", "A high-quality, photorealistic emotional close-up portrait of a beautiful young Asian woman. She has short, messy, wet black hair with strands clinging to her face and neck, creating a disheveled yet alluring look. She is wearing a simple black spaghetti-strap camisole, revealing her collarbones and cleavage. A chunky silver chain necklace with pearl accents rests around her neck. Her skin is glistening with a wet, dewy texture, particularly on her neck and chest, highlighted by the dramatic lighting. She is looking slightly to the side with an intense, melancholic, yet captivating expression, her lips slightly parted. Strong, focused side hard light casts distinct highlights and shadows, emphasizing her features and the wet textures. The background is a rough, textured gray wall. 8k resolution, cinematic lighting, high contrast, wet look, grunge aesthetic, sharp focus on eyes and skin texture", "A high-quality, photorealistic fashion portrait of a fit and energetic young Asian woman, captured in a studio setting. She is striking a dynamic side pose, looking back over her right shoulder at the camera. She wears a white cropped blouse with a black necktie, revealing her midriff, paired with shiny black high-waisted leather hot pants featuring intricate lace-up details on the sides, perfectly accentuating her sculpted glutes and leg lines. Her long, straight black hair is styled in a high ponytail with bangs. Her makeup is fresh and vibrant, with noticeable rosy cheeks and glossy orange-red lips. The lighting is soft and even front-side light, creating subtle contours on her body. The background is a clean, plain light gray studio wall, ensuring the focus remains entirely on the subject. 8k resolution, cinematic quality, sharp focus on the face and body contours, high-key lighting, emphasizing body shape and confidence."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "optional_prompt_list", "label": "列表（可选）", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "optional_prompt_list"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_1"}, "name": "prompt_1", "label": "prompt_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_2"}, "name": "prompt_2", "label": "prompt_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_3"}, "name": "prompt_3", "label": "prompt_3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_4"}, "name": "prompt_4", "label": "prompt_4", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_4"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_5"}, "name": "prompt_5", "label": "prompt_5", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_5"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptList", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [406.0674133300781, 730.5181274414062], "pos": [-674.73974609375, 392.6214599609375], "id": 42, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptList"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [226.33175168984485, 306.0270838226327], "scale": 0.5209868481924381}}, "groups": [{"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Z-Image + Z-Image-Turbo Dual Sampling", "bounding": [-209.8994598388672, -17.72056007385254, 3005.1982421875, 732.908935546875]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "SeedVR2", "bo